        "default_value": "Da Vinci Precision",
        "show_in_rest": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "field_editorial_statement_1",
        "label": "Editorial Statement Line 1",
        "name": "editorial_statement_1",
        "type": "text",
        "default_value": "A second opinion is not disloyalty.",
        "show_in_rest": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "field_editorial_statement_2",
        "label": "Editorial Statement Line 2",
        "name": "editorial_statement_2",
        "type": "text",
        "default_value": "It is an essential oncological safeguard.",
        "show_in_rest": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "field_editorial_lead_prose",
        "label": "Editorial Lead Paragraph",
        "name": "editorial_lead_prose",
        "type": "textarea",
        "default_value": "The days following a biopsy are often overwhelmed by shock, urgent advice, and irreversible choices. Patients are told that surgery must take place tomorrow.",
        "show_in_rest": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "field_editorial_body_prose",
        "label": "Editorial Body Paragraph",
        "name": "editorial_body_prose",
        "type": "textarea",
        "default_value": "Yet in thirty years of specialized surgical oncology, we know that taking 3 to 5 days to confirm histological receptors, re-examine scan boundaries, and explore organ preservation does not compromise curative outcomes. It protects both life and enduring dignity.",
        "show_in_rest": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "field_surgeon_profile_bio",
        "label": "Surgeon Profile Detailed Bio",
        "name": "surgeon_profile_bio",
        "type": "textarea",
        "default_value": "Trained in the United Kingdom, Italy, Singapore and India, including a UICC Fellowship in Milan under Professor Umberto Veronesi, he was formerly Additional Professor of Surgical Oncology at the Regional Cancer Centre, Thiruvananthapuram. He heads the Aster Clinical Research Centre and is Lead Principal Investigator on clinical trials.",
        "show_in_rest": 1
      }
    ],
